239
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,660
[He deliberately wet my dress.]

240
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:45,980
[in a disgraceful way.]

241
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,980
[The Old Madam in the novel pays the most attention to rules.]

242
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:49,200
[The Old Madam in the novel pays the most attention to rules.]

243
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,260
[If I go like this,]

244
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,000
